Z||000009||Pontiaddict||10-15-2000||03:21 AM||||Solving a Rubiks cube is easy. Just peel off the stickers and put them back the way they are supposed to be.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I always liked trying to scrape all of the silver stuff off the face of an etch-a-sketch using the knobs. Never did finish.||||reg||1
